    <headline>Flood Warning — Rivertown coastal area</headline>
    <description>Heavy rainfall (180mm in 6h) has caused the Rivulet river to breach its banks. Low-lying wards 1-3 are at immediate risk of flooding. Residents advised to move to higher ground.</description>
    <instruction>Move to designated shelters. Avoid riverfront roads. Do not drive through flooded streets.</instruction>
    <area>
      <areaDesc>Rivertown Wards 1-3, coastal Rivulet basin</areaDesc>
      <polygon>19.05,72.85 19.05,72.90 19.10,72.90 19.10,72.85</polygon>
      <geocode value="RIVERTOWN-W1">Ward 1</geocode>
      <geocode value="RIVERTOWN-W2">Ward 2</geocode>
      <geocode value="RIVERTOWN-W3">Ward 3</geocode>
    </area>
